notes.notes:
Hospital improvements:
 - The room indication book is now at reception. To be closer to the place where the player gets the keys;

 - Side arrows indicate that the player can enter the offices, many people don't realize that there are doors in that location;

 - Added an indication/tutorial, to improve the perception that you should use the keys to kill the nurses who are in the corridors of the rooms;

- There was a bug where if the player passes behind the nurses on floors 2 and 3 and came back, the nurses would not be deactivated and the player would be detected instantly; [SOLVED]

Final Hideout Improvements:
 - The Mantis from the last chase is a little slower;
 - New indications in the maze;

Changes at the hospital:

Hospital elevator bugs:
 - Character crashed when trying to leave the interaction (Pressing C or selecting current floor); [SOLVED]
 - Active interaction during the elevator transition, which could possibly crash the game; [SOLVED]

Safe Puzzle:
 - Number confirmation sound: Volume increased;

Closed doors in the hospital were not correctly translated into English [SOLVED]

First nurse (tutorial):
 - Decreased speed;
 - 100% chance of stopping when reaching one of the extreme points;
 - Checkpoint added after completing the tutorial and activating the jumpscare;

Visual indications on the cafeteria and staircase keys:
 - When you pick up the key, an arrow will indicate that the door can be opened;



Initial control support added, still no visual cues.
